### Customer Reward Campaign — the demo, in order
#
# Run these from the top. Each request feeds the next, so no id is ever pasted by hand.
# Works in Visual Studio, VS Code with the REST Client extension, and Rider.
#
# Before you start:
#   docker compose up -d
#   dotnet run --project Campaign.Api --urls http://localhost:5088
#
# Use Directory:Provider = InMemory unless the public SOAP service is answering; the customer search
# in step 5 is the one call that depends on it.

@host = http://localhost:5088

###############################################################################
# 1. The API is up. No token needed - this is the only endpoint besides the
#    development login that does not ask for one.
###############################################################################

GET {{host}}/health

###############################################################################
# 2. Without a token everything else is 401 unauthenticated, in the same
#    ProblemDetails shape every other refusal uses.
###############################################################################

GET {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns

###############################################################################
# 3. Sign in as an agent. This endpoint exists in Development only - outside it
#    the controller is removed from the application and the route is a 404.
###############################################################################

# @name agentLogin
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "agent-1", "password": "agent-1-password" }

@agent = {{agentLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

###############################################################################
# 4. The campaigns this agent can work in. The seed writes one, running from
#    three days ago to three days ahead.
###############################################################################

# @name campaigns
GET {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{agent}}

@campaignId = {{campaigns.response.body.$[0].id}}

###############################################################################
# 5. Today's quota, before anything is awarded: used 0 of the campaign's limit.
#    The businessDate in the answer is the campaign's time zone, not the
#    caller's - the agent page uses it instead of guessing.
###############################################################################

# @name quotaBefore
GET {{host}}/api/v1/agents/me/quota?campaignId={{campaignId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agent}}

###############################################################################
# 6. Find a customer in the external catalogue.
###############################################################################

GET {{host}}/api/v1/customers?name=Ana
Authorization: Bearer {{agent}}

###############################################################################
# 7. Award the discount. Idempotency-Key is required.
#    Expect 201 with a Location header.
###############################################################################

# @name firstGrant
POST {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/grants
Authorization: Bearer {{agent}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 11111111-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-111111111111

{ "customerExternalId": "1" }

@grantId = {{firstGrant.response.body.$.id}}

###############################################################################
# 8. P-06: the same key and the same request again.
#    Expect 200, header Idempotency-Replayed: true, and the same grant id.
#    Nothing was created.
###############################################################################

POST {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/grants
Authorization: Bearer {{agent}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 11111111-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-111111111111

{ "customerExternalId": "1" }

###############################################################################
# 9. P-06, the other half: the same key for a different customer.
#    Expect 409 idempotency-key-reused. A key never hands back a grant somebody
#    did not ask for.
###############################################################################

POST {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/grants
Authorization: Bearer {{agent}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 11111111-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-111111111111

{ "customerExternalId": "2" }

###############################################################################
# 10. P-03: the same customer again under a new key.
#     Expect 409 customer-already-rewarded, with the id of the grant that holds
#     the customer in the body.
###############################################################################

POST {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/grants
Authorization: Bearer {{agent}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 22222222-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-222222222222

{ "customerExternalId": "1" }

###############################################################################
# 11. Fill the day: four more customers, so the agent reaches the limit of five.
###############################################################################

POST {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/grants
Authorization: Bearer {{agent}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 33333333-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-333333333333

{ "customerExternalId": "2" }

###

POST {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/grants
Authorization: Bearer {{agent}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 44444444-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-444444444444

{ "customerExternalId": "3" }

###

POST {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/grants
Authorization: Bearer {{agent}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 55555555-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-555555555555

{ "customerExternalId": "4" }

###

POST {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/grants
Authorization: Bearer {{agent}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 66666666-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-666666666666

{ "customerExternalId": "5" }

###############################################################################
# 12. P-02: the sixth customer today.
#     Expect 409 daily-limit-reached, with used and limit in the body.
###############################################################################

POST {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/grants
Authorization: Bearer {{agent}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 77777777-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-777777777777

{ "customerExternalId": "6" }

###############################################################################
# 13. The agent's own grants. An agent sees their own and nobody else's.
###############################################################################

GET {{host}}/api/v1/grants?campaignId={{campaignId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agent}}

###############################################################################
# 14. P-04 and P-05: void the first grant. Nothing is deleted; the record keeps
#     the reason, the actor and the time. Expect 204.
###############################################################################

POST {{host}}/api/v1/grants/{{grantId}}/void
Authorization: Bearer {{agent}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "wrong customer picked from the list" }

###############################################################################
# 15. Voiding it again. Expect 409 grant-already-voided - the conditional
#     update changed no row, so somebody was there first.
###############################################################################

POST {{host}}/api/v1/grants/{{grantId}}/void
Authorization: Bearer {{agent}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "again" }

###############################################################################
# 16. The slot came back on its own: used is one lower than before the void.
#     Nothing releases it - the count only counts active grants.
###############################################################################

GET {{host}}/api/v1/agents/me/quota?campaignId={{campaignId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agent}}

###############################################################################
# 17. An agent may not read the report. Expect 403 forbidden.
###############################################################################

GET {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/results?groupBy=agent
Authorization: Bearer {{agent}}

###############################################################################
# 18. The integration account: a system account for the import, not a person.
###############################################################################

# @name integrationLogin
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "integration-1", "password": "integration-1-password" }

@integration = {{integrationLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

###############################################################################
# 19. The purchase report. One customer bought three times, and all three rows
#     match one grant. Expect 200 with the summary - never 202.
###############################################################################

# @name cleanImport
POST {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/imports
Authorization: Bearer {{integration}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----CampaignBoundary

------CampaignBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="purchases-clean.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./samples/purchases-clean.csv
------CampaignBoundary--

@batchId = {{cleanImport.response.body.$.id}}

###############################################################################
# 20. P-08: the same file again. Expect 200, the same batch id, and
#     alreadyImported: true. No second batch was made.
###############################################################################

POST {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/imports
Authorization: Bearer {{integration}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----CampaignBoundary

------CampaignBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="purchases-clean.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./samples/purchases-clean.csv
------CampaignBoundary--

###############################################################################
# 21. A deliberately dirty file: bad dates, an empty customer id, an unknown
#     customer, an amount without a currency, a broken amount. Every row gets a
#     status, the file runs to the end, and the three counts add up to
#     rowsTotal. Status is CompletedWithErrors.
###############################################################################

POST {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/imports
Authorization: Bearer {{integration}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----CampaignBoundary

------CampaignBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="purchases-dirty.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./samples/purchases-dirty.csv
------CampaignBoundary--

###############################################################################
# 22. The batch of the clean file, row by row. An invalid row keeps its raw line
#     and its reason and no parsed field at all.
###############################################################################

GET {{host}}/api/v1/imports/{{batchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{integration}}

###############################################################################
# 23. A file that is not a purchase report. Expect 400 csv-invalid - the whole
#     file is refused, which is different from a row that cannot be read.
###############################################################################

POST {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/imports
Authorization: Bearer {{integration}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----CampaignBoundary

------CampaignBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="not-a-report.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

Nothing;To;See
1;2;3
------CampaignBoundary--

###############################################################################
# 24. The admin account, for the report.
###############################################################################

# @name adminLogin
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin-1", "password": "admin-1-password" }

@admin = {{adminLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

###############################################################################
# 25. P-09, grouped by agent. The customer who bought three times converted one
#     grant: convertedGrants counts grants and matchedRows counts rows, so
#     conversion cannot pass 100% even when matchedRows is the larger number.
#     A voided grant is in neither the numerator nor the denominator.
#     Every number comes from vw_CampaignResults, which SSRS can read too.
###############################################################################

GET {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/results?groupBy=agent
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

###############################################################################
# 26. The same numbers grouped by business date. Same totals, different rows.
###############################################################################

GET {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/results?groupBy=day
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

###############################################################################
# 27. The purchases that matched no active grant. Reported, never dropped in
#     silence - this is the half of the report that says who bought without
#     being rewarded.
###############################################################################

GET {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/unmatched-purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

###############################################################################
# 28. An unknown grouping. Expect 400 validation-failed.
###############################################################################

GET {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/results?groupBy=month
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

###############################################################################
# 29. An unknown import batch. Expect 404 import-batch-not-found - its own type,
#     not a grant's.
###############################################################################

GET {{host}}/api/v1/imports/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{integration}}
